            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.poster.avif?t=1741603047\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.webm?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.mp4?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status – Important Note:</strong><br><i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> was originally planned to be a full single-player adventure <strong>with both story-driven content and a wave shooter mode</strong>. However, <strong>development has been discontinued</strong>, and the game remains in its current form—a <strong>wave-based shooter</strong> designed to test core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than keep <i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> in Early Access forever, I wanted to be transparent and officially close this chapter. I did not reach my original goal of developing a full <strong>single-player campaign alongside the wave shooter mode</strong>. However, as some players requested, I’ve kept the finished aspects of the game available for those who want to explore them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this project—hopefully, we’ll see you for the next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR: Under a Desert Sun</strong> places you in the heart of a classic pulp adventure, reminiscent of the action-packed stories from old movies. Step into the role of a reluctant hero in World War II, battling against ruthless Nazi forces and an ancient magical power that has awakened from the desert sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR experience features <strong>realistic weapon handling and immersive environmental interactions</strong>, bringing the adventure to life in a way only virtual reality can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game will not receive further updates, this <strong>horde mode remains fully playable</strong>, offering an arcade-style VR shooting experience in a pulpy, action-packed setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is there?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapon handling:</strong> use your controllers to handle realistic world war 2 weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight:</strong> use your flying skills to fly airplanes and avoid death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free movement and exploration:</strong> explore large environments any way you want.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impressive VR Graphics:</strong> feel immersed in the desert while being overwhelmed by the desert hordes. Incredibly detailed environments, weapons and enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR only:</strong> this game has been built from the ground up for VR. All interactions and mechanics were built to experience in VR.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Join us on discord:   to give feedback, post bugs or just have a general chat about Under a Desert Sun!</u></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.poster.avif?t=1741603047\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.webm?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/587930/extras/3d49ed5c120064bc1663e95a7a83500b.mp4?t=1741603047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Status – Important Note:</strong><br><i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> was originally planned to be a full single-player adventure <strong>with both story-driven content and a wave shooter mode</strong>. However, <strong>development has been discontinued</strong>, and the game remains in its current form—a <strong>wave-based shooter</strong> designed to test core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than keep <i>VR: Under a Desert Sun</i> in Early Access forever, I wanted to be transparent and officially close this chapter. I did not reach my original goal of developing a full <strong>single-player campaign alongside the wave shooter mode</strong>. However, as some players requested, I’ve kept the finished aspects of the game available for those who want to explore them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who supported this project—hopefully, we’ll see you for the next adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR: Under a Desert Sun</strong> places you in the heart of a classic pulp adventure, reminiscent of the action-packed stories from old movies. Step into the role of a reluctant hero in World War II, battling against ruthless Nazi forces and an ancient magical power that has awakened from the desert sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VR experience features <strong>realistic weapon handling and immersive environmental interactions</strong>, bringing the adventure to life in a way only virtual reality can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game will not receive further updates, this <strong>horde mode remains fully playable</strong>, offering an arcade-style VR shooting experience in a pulpy, action-packed setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is there?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapon handling:</strong> use your controllers to handle realistic world war 2 weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight:</strong> use your flying skills to fly airplanes and avoid death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free movement and exploration:</strong> explore large environments any way you want.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impressive VR Graphics:</strong> feel immersed in the desert while being overwhelmed by the desert hordes. Incredibly detailed environments, weapons and enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR only:</strong> this game has been built from the ground up for VR. All interactions and mechanics were built to experience in VR.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Join us on discord:   to give feedback, post bugs or just have a general chat about Under a Desert Sun!</u></p>",
